# Horticulture & Botany Taste Considerations & Philosophical Probes
#
# Sessile intelligence, the seed covenant, biophilic sanctuaries, and wonder probes across the plant kingdom.

#>spw_cache_univ_hort_botany_taste
#:cache #!horticulture_and_botany
#:layer #!pragmatics

^"intent"{
  ~#goal: "Synthesize the aesthetic contemplation, ecological ethics, and biological reverences that define botany, horticultural cultivation, and human-plant reciprocity."
  ~#resonance: "Sessile adaptation, heirloom seed custody, botanical biophilia, and the quiet dignity of photosynthetic life"
}

^["the_sessile_intelligence_of_plants"]{
  evolutionary_wonder: "Because plants cannot run away from drought, cold, or predators, they evolved a biochemical sophistication that dwarfs that of animals."
  botanical_sublime: #[
    "The Chemical Alchemist: A plant cannot walk to a pharmacy; it synthesizes thousands of secondary metabolites to poison herbivores, lure pollinators, and heal its own wounds",
    "Phototropic Dance: Following the sun with circadian micro-movements, maximizing photon capture without ever tearing its vascular stem",
    "Somatic Immortality: Unlike animals with fixed adult organ sets, a 1,000-year-old olive tree can continuously generate brand-new leaves, roots, and flowers from embryonic meristems"
  ]
}

^["the_sacred_covenant_of_the_seed"]{
  intergenerational_inheritance: "A seed is an embryonic miracle containing ten thousand generations of human selection, climate memory, and life."
  ethical_imperatives: #[
    "Resisting Monoculture Erasure: Over 90% of historic vegetable varieties have vanished from commercial catalogs in a century; saving heirloom seeds is an act of cultural and ecological resistance",
    "Against Seed Enclosure: Opposing utility patents on living germplasm that criminalize farmers for saving their own seed; championing the Open Source Seed Initiative (OSSI)",
    "Traditional Ecological Knowledge (TEK): Honoring indigenous agroforestry and companion planting (the Three Sisters: maize, beans, squash) as sophisticated ecological science"
  ]
}

^["botanical_sanctuaries_and_human_spirit"]{
  biophilic_necessity: "Human neurobiology evolved in deep immersion with green leaves and living soil; concrete sterility induces chronic low-grade psychic distress."
  healing_spaces: #[
    "The Winter Greenhouse: Stepping out of a freezing asphalt city into a warm glasshouse filled with the scent of damp loam, citrus blossoms, and ferns restores the soul",
    "The Public Botanical Garden: A living museum of biodiversity where working-class city dwellers can commune with tropical orchids and ancient cycads for free",
    "Horticultural Therapy: Gardening as a profound somatic intervention for clinical depression, PTSD, and cognitive recovery in veterans and elders"
  ]
}

^"taste"{
  ~#taste: "To care for a plant is to accept an unhurried cadence of time that mocks our hurried modern anxieties."
  ~#wonder: "Can human cities be re-engineered so that buildings function as vertical living ecosystems that purify air, harvest water, and grow food?"
}

^"invariants"{
  "Conservation of endangered plant taxa must prioritize in-situ habitat preservation alongside ex-situ seed bank storage.",
  "Horticultural practices must minimize synthetic chemical runoff into surrounding watersheds to protect aquatic pollinator ecosystems.",
  "Traditional and indigenous plant knowledge must not be commercially exploited without prior informed consent and benefit-sharing.",
}

#>wonder_hort_botany_taste_1
?["Can vertical agro-forestry facades reduce interior building cooling loads by 40% while generating hyper-local urban food yields?"]{
  #:depth #!ecological ~#lens(biophilic_architecture)
  ~#hypothesis: "Integrating deciduous kiwi and grape vines onto southern urban building facades provides 80% summer solar shading (cutting air conditioning loads by 42%) while dropping leaves in winter to allow passive solar heating, producing 15 kg of fresh fruit per square meter annually."
  !probe{ "Measure surface temperatures, indoor thermal flux, and fruit yield on green-wall test facades across four seasons in temperate urban centers." }
  $%[architecture.cooling_energy_reduction_percent, urban_ag.annual_fruit_yield_kg_m2]
}

#>wonder_hort_botany_taste_2
?["What molecular signal triggers synchronous masting—when millions of oak trees across an entire continent drop acorns in the exact same autumn?"]{
  #:depth #!botanical ~#lens(continental_plant_synchrony)
  ~#hypothesis: "Continent-wide masting is coordinated by volatile organic compound (VOC) atmospheric plumes released during spring temperature-weather cues that trigger synchronized flower bud maturation across vast geographic distances."
  !probe{ "Cross-reference satellite NDVI canopy reflectance, weather anomalies, and atmospheric terpene concentrations during continental masting years." }
  $%[ecology.masting_synchrony_index, atmospheric.canopy_terpene_flux]
}
